<h3>JSP Declaration Tag</h3>
<p>Using JSP Declaration tag we can write varibles methods in our JSP file.</p>
<p>Example of Declaration tag:</p><br/>
<%!
int age=25;
%>

<% 
out.println("The age is a :"+age);
%>
</body>
</html>